{
  "$schema": "https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json",
  "extends": [
    "config:recommended"
],
"platform": "github",
"autodiscover": true,
"autodiscoverFilter": [
    "MiguelPedraz/tasksapi"
  ],
"baseBranches": [
    "develop"
],
"gitAuthor": "Renovate Bot <bot@renovateapp.com>",
  "ignoreDeps": [],
"ignoreUnstable": true,
"respectLatest": true,
"enabledManagers": [
    "gradle",
    "gradle-wrapper",
    "github-actions"
],
"hostRules": [
    {
        "matchHost": "https://repo1.maven.org",
        "description": "Maven Central (Sonatype CDN) - Primary source for Maven dependencies"
    }
],
  "packageRules": [
    {
    "description": "Ignore non-stable versions globally (all managers)",
    "allowedVersions": "!/^.*(-alpha|-beta|-rc|-snapshot|-dev|-pre|-milestone|-m\\d+).*$/i"
},
{
    "description": "Auto-merge minor/patch updates for all Maven dependencies",
      "matchDatasources": ["maven"],
      "matchUpdateTypes": ["minor", "patch"],
      "automerge": true,
      "automergeType": "pr",
      "automergeStrategy": "squash"
    },
    {
    "description": "Group Spring Framework updates",
      "matchDatasources": ["maven"],
    "matchPackagePrefixes": [
        "org.springframework"
    ],
      "schedule": ["before 3am on Monday"],
    "groupName": "Spring Framework",
    "prBodyNotes": [
        "📦 **Spring Framework Dependencies Cross-Check:**",
        "",
        "Verify compatibility with related dependencies in `libs.versions.toml`:",
        "- `spring-boot` → Current: 4.0.2",
        "- `spring-dependency-management` → Current: 1.1.7",
        "",
        "🔗 [Spring Boot Release Notes](https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/releases)",
        "🔗 [Compatibility Matrix](https://spring.io/projects/spring-boot#support)"
    ]
},
{
    "description": "Testcontainers - Allow major updates but require manual review",
    "matchDatasources": [
        "maven"
    ],
    "matchPackageNames": [
        "org.testcontainers:testcontainers",
        "org.testcontainers:junit-jupiter",
        "org.testcontainers:postgresql"
    ],
    "matchUpdateTypes": [
        "major"
    ],
    "automerge": false,
    "stabilityDays": 3,
    "groupName": "Testcontainers Major Update",
    "groupSlug": "testcontainers-major",
    "prPriority": 10,
    "prBodyNotes": [
        "⚠️ **CRITICAL: Multi-Module Dependency Check**",
        "",
        "This PR updates **Testcontainers** which has multiple modules defined in `libs.versions.toml` using the **same version variable**:",
        "",
        "```toml",
        "testcontainers = \"{{{newVersion}}}\"  # Shared version for all modules",
        "```",
        "",
        "### 🔍 Affected Modules (All must exist in Maven Central):",
        "",
        "| Module | Package Name | Status Link |",
        "|--------|--------------|-------------|",
        "| testcontainers-core | `org.testcontainers:testcontainers` | [Verify v{{{newVersion}}}](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.testcontainers/testcontainers/{{{newVersion}}}) |",
        "| testcontainers-junit | `org.testcontainers:junit-jupiter` | [Verify v{{{newVersion}}}](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.testcontainers/junit-jupiter/{{{newVersion}}}) |",
        "| testcontainers-postgresql | `org.testcontainers:postgresql` | [Verify v{{{newVersion}}}](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.testcontainers/postgresql/{{{newVersion}}}) |",
        "",
        "### ❌ Known Issue - Version {{{newVersion}}}:",
        "```",
        "Could not find org.testcontainers:junit-jupiter:{{{newVersion}}}",
        "Could not find org.testcontainers:postgresql:{{{newVersion}}}",
        "```",
        "",
        "### ✅ Merge Checklist:",
        "- [ ] All 3 modules exist with version {{{newVersion}}} in Maven Central",
        "- [ ] Build passes in CI/CD",
        "- [ ] No dependency resolution errors in logs",
        "",
        "**⚠️ If ANY module is missing, DO NOT MERGE - wait for synchronized release**"
    ],
    "prFooter": "📦 [View all Testcontainers artifacts](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.testcontainers) | 🔗 [Release Notes](https://github.com/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/releases/tag/v{{{newVersion}}})"
},
{
    "description": "Testcontainers - Auto-merge minor/patch updates",
    "matchDatasources": [
        "maven"
    ],
    "matchPackageNames": [
        "org.testcontainers:testcontainers",
        "org.testcontainers:junit-jupiter",
        "org.testcontainers:postgresql"
    ],
    "matchUpdateTypes": [
        "minor",
        "patch"
    ],
    "automerge": true,
    "groupName": "Testcontainers",
    "groupSlug": "testcontainers",
    "prBodyNotes": [
        "📦 **Testcontainers Multi-Module Update**",
        "",
        "All modules use shared version in `libs.versions.toml`:",
        "- `org.testcontainers:testcontainers`",
        "- `org.testcontainers:junit-jupiter`",
        "- `org.testcontainers:postgresql`",
        "",
        "Auto-merge enabled - patch/minor updates are usually safe ✅"
    ]
},
{
    "description": "Group Testing frameworks with module dependency info",
      "matchDatasources": ["maven"],
    "matchPackageNames": [
        "org.junit.jupiter:junit-jupiter",
        "org.junit.platform:junit-platform-launcher",
        "org.mockito:mockito-core",
        "org.mockito:mockito-junit-jupiter",
        "io.rest-assured:rest-assured"
    ],
    "groupName": "Testing Dependencies",
    "prBodyNotes": [
        "🧪 **Testing Dependencies - Multi-Module Check**",
        "",
        "### Modules sharing version variables in `libs.versions.toml`:",
        "",
        "**JUnit (version: `junit-jupiter = \"6.0.2\"`)**",
        "- `org.junit.jupiter:junit-jupiter` → Test framework core",
        "- `org.junit.platform:junit-platform-launcher` → Platform (version managed by BOM)",
        "",
        "**Mockito (version: `mockito = \"5.12.0\"`)**",
        "- `org.mockito:mockito-core` → Mocking framework core  ",
        "- `org.mockito:mockito-junit-jupiter` → JUnit 5 integration",
        "",
        "**REST Assured (version: `rest-assured = \"6.0.0\"`)**",
        "- `io.rest-assured:rest-assured` → Standalone",
        "",
        "⚠️ **Compatibility:** JUnit 6.x requires Java 21+",
        "🔗 [JUnit Docs](https://junit.org/junit5/docs/current/user-guide/) | [Mockito Docs](https://javadoc.io/doc/org.mockito/mockito-core/latest/)"
    ]
    },
    {
    "description": "Group Database drivers",
    "matchDatasources": [
        "maven"
    ],
    "matchPackagePrefixes": [
        "org.postgresql",
        "com.h2database"
    ],
    "groupName": "Database Drivers",
    "prBodyNotes": [
        "🗄️ **Database Dependencies in libs.versions.toml:**",
        "",
        "| Driver | Current Version | Used By |",
        "|--------|----------------|---------|",
        "| postgresql | 42.7.10 | Production runtime |",
        "| h2 | 2.4.240 | Testing & development |",
        "",
        "**Related:** Testcontainers PostgreSQL module (testcontainers-postgresql) version: 1.21.4",
        "",
        "🔗 [PostgreSQL JDBC Changelog](https://jdbc.postgresql.org/changelogs/)",
        "🔗 [H2 Database Changelog](http://www.h2database.com/html/changelog.html)"
    ]
},
{
    "description": "Group Observability tools",
      "matchDatasources": ["maven"],
    "matchPackagePrefixes": [
        "io.micrometer",
        "org.springdoc"
    ],
    "groupName": "Observability & Documentation"
},
{
    "description": "Group Build tools and Gradle plugins",
    "matchManagers": [
        "gradle"
    ],
    "matchDepTypes": [
        "plugin"
    ],
    "groupName": "Build Tools & Plugins"
},
{
    "description": "Stable releases for GitHub Actions",
    "matchManagers": [
        "github-actions"
    ],
    "pinDigests": false,
    "semanticCommits": "enabled"
    }
  ],
  "labels": ["dependencies", "automated"],
"assignees": [
    "@MiguelPedraz"
],
  "schedule": ["after 10pm every weekday", "before 5am every weekday"],
  "timezone": "Europe/Madrid",
  "prConcurrentLimit": 5,
  "prCreation": "immediate",
"rebaseWhen": "behind-base-branch",
  "lockFileMaintenance": {
    "enabled": true,
    "schedule": ["before 3am on Monday"]
  }
}
